  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.4.4 - iOS Mobile Platform Fix\n- Fixed static constructor blocking on iOS/mobile platforms\n- Improved mobile platform detection with timeouts\n- Prevents license activation timeout on iOS devices\n\nv1.0.4.2 - Maintenance Release\n- Documentation improvements\n- Build configuration updates\n\nv1.0.3.2 - Server Rejection Handling\n- Background server registration\n- Improved error messages from server\n\nv1.0.2.2 - iOS/macOS AES Fix\n- Fixed PlatformNotSupportedException on Apple platforms\n- CrossPlatformAesGcm wrapper using BouncyCastle for iOS/macOS\n\nv1.0.1.0 - Distribution Licenses\n- Added Distribution License type for App Store/Play Store apps\n- No hardware binding, unlimited activations",
